{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factoriant is a factory builder where you build a sprawling underground factory\u2014run entirely by ants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young queen ant. Dig tunnels, carry food, hatch workers, and automate your colony's production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a vast subterranean factory where thousands of ants work tirelessly, day and night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digging the Nest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/ae758df041cdaeb4d79b8daef9356f0b.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/ae758df041cdaeb4d79b8daef9356f0b.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/ae758df041cdaeb4d79b8daef9356f0b.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your underground factory needs space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your tunnels to optimize logistics, secure production zones, and defend against intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/58f572993b5dc7672af696266798e959.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/58f572993b5dc7672af696266798e959.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/58f572993b5dc7672af696266798e959.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every task can be automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ant lines deliver food and materials. Ants assemble products, research new technologies\u2014and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your colony grows, even flying bees and rail-running tortoises will become part of your industrial empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Industrialization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper to uncover mineral resources like ores and oil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay down pipelines and turn your nest into a fully industrialized powerhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to invade human homes, and you might even harness gas and electricity as powerful energy sources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Natural Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/3a486407d43aa14e19eeb98d30fa5f3b.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/3a486407d43aa14e19eeb98d30fa5f3b.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/3a486407d43aa14e19eeb98d30fa5f3b.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry birds prey on your workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious kids flood your tunnels just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re no ordinary ant\u2014arm yourself and fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Animal Behaviors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/393d0189599c0c72d77740cb3cbb253d.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/393d0189599c0c72d77740cb3cbb253d.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/393d0189599c0c72d77740cb3cbb253d.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>While stylized for fun, the game draws inspiration from real-world animal ecology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the farming behavior of leafcutter ants, predation by wrynecks, and fascinating symbiotic relationships with eumyrmococcus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Multiplayer: Online multiplayer support is planned.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles &amp; Rails: Build transportation networks both underground and above ground to reach distant resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World: Seamlessly generated maps offer fresh exploration every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2332860?t=1761053641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2332860?t=1761053641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/5f21048ef3bf6617e768ef26a1475a9a0f6f5ed5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761053641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/5f21048ef3bf6617e768ef26a1475a9a0f6f5ed5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761053641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factoriant is a factory builder where you build a sprawling underground factory\u2014run entirely by ants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young queen ant. Dig tunnels, carry food, hatch workers, and automate your colony's production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a vast subterranean factory where thousands of ants work tirelessly, day and night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digging the Nest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/ae758df041cdaeb4d79b8daef9356f0b.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/ae758df041cdaeb4d79b8daef9356f0b.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/ae758df041cdaeb4d79b8daef9356f0b.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your underground factory needs space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your tunnels to optimize logistics, secure production zones, and defend against intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/58f572993b5dc7672af696266798e959.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/58f572993b5dc7672af696266798e959.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/58f572993b5dc7672af696266798e959.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every task can be automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ant lines deliver food and materials. Ants assemble products, research new technologies\u2014and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your colony grows, even flying bees and rail-running tortoises will become part of your industrial empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Industrialization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper to uncover mineral resources like ores and oil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay down pipelines and turn your nest into a fully industrialized powerhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to invade human homes, and you might even harness gas and electricity as powerful energy sources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Natural Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/3a486407d43aa14e19eeb98d30fa5f3b.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/3a486407d43aa14e19eeb98d30fa5f3b.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/3a486407d43aa14e19eeb98d30fa5f3b.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry birds prey on your workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious kids flood your tunnels just for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re no ordinary ant\u2014arm yourself and fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Animal Behaviors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/393d0189599c0c72d77740cb3cbb253d.poster.avif?t=1761053641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/393d0189599c0c72d77740cb3cbb253d.webm?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/extras/393d0189599c0c72d77740cb3cbb253d.mp4?t=1761053641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>While stylized for fun, the game draws inspiration from real-world animal ecology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the farming behavior of leafcutter ants, predation by wrynecks, and fascinating symbiotic relationships with eumyrmococcus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Multiplayer: Online multiplayer support is planned.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles &amp; Rails: Build transportation networks both underground and above ground to reach distant resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World: Seamlessly generated maps offer fresh exploration every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Marudice"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332860/acbfb8d61c5eff3de963c8a65eeb42af3f3d5288/header.jpg?t=1761053641","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Marudice 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2332860/171262878/89309e4828e079d0d914921b8d69d87fac842620/1760366594/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761053637","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2332860/171262